= Using the staticarray class =

The [../classes/html/classstaticarray.html staticarray class] allows you to store a pre-defined number of values and access them with array-like syntax.  Since the staticarray class is template-based, you can store arbitrary types of values.

Unlike the [dynamicarray.html dynamicarray class], the size of a staticarray is fixed at compile time via a template parameter and cannot grow or shrink.

The following example creates a staticarray of 5 integers, sets and modifies values, zeroes a range of elements, and clears the array.

